# Penumbra lejana (B-23 lote 2 «b»): el bosque a 40–100 bloques desde (170,5, 90, 166,5) mirando 10° abajo, sol a ~35°.
close
command gamemode spectator
command weather clear
command gamerule advance_time false
command time set 1510
command tp @s 170.5 90 166.5 0 10
sleep 8
look 0 10
sleep 4
screenshot sombras-lejos
